# T7.1 — keep the production build context lean. The image ships app/ + db/
# and the nginx delivery sources (see infra/nginx/Dockerfile); everything else is build noise or secret
# material (SH-2: no secrets, no dev state in the image).
.venv/
.git/
.gitignore
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.pytest_cache/
graphify-out/
backups/
media/
node_modules/
tests/
docs/
# One docs subtree is runtime input, not build noise: `docs/kb` is the source the
# deployed release check re-seeds from (ops.md §2.5).
!docs/kb/
!docs/kb/**
openspec/
infra/*
!infra/nginx/
!infra/nginx/**
.env*
